# Misty Mountains Raider: "Whenever you attack, amass Goblins 2." (CR 508.1m, 701.47a). Attacking with the Raider and a
# Goblin Assailant together triggers it once (the attack is declared once): a Goblin Army token with two +1/+1 counters, not
# four. A later attack with the Raider alone adds two more counters to that same Army. No attack, no trigger: the turns
# between (the opponent's) leave the Army as it is.

